---
import Base from '@layouts/Base.astro';
import Page from '@layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Base meta_title="About">
  <Page title="About Mustafa">
    <p>
      I am Mustafa Kashoul Melli, a Software Engineer currently working at Seek. I focus on building modern web
      applications that are fast, scalable, and easy to use.
    </p>

    <p>
      My core stack includes JavaScript, TypeScript, React, Next.js, and frontend architecture patterns that support
      long-term product growth. I enjoy turning complex requirements into clean, maintainable solutions and delivering
      experiences that feel simple for end users.
    </p>

    <h4>How I Work</h4>
    <p>
      I care about strong engineering fundamentals, clear communication, and continuous improvement. My goal is to ship
      reliable features while keeping code quality high through thoughtful design, testing, and collaboration.
    </p>

    <h4>What I Share Here</h4>
    <p>
      This blog is where I document lessons from real projects, explore software design ideas, and write about practical
      frontend development topics that help teams build better products.
    </p>

    <h4>Let's Connect!</h4>
    <p>
      I am always open to collaborations, interesting product challenges, and conversations about web engineering. If
      you would like to connect, feel free to reach out through my social links.
    </p>
  </Page>
</Base>
